# Owner of record for this repository.
#
# This file establishes who is accountable for the repository. It does NOT, on its own, require
# review on a pull request: review is only mandatory if branch protection has
# "Require review from Code Owners" switched on.
#
# IMPORTANT, and easy to get wrong: do NOT enable "Require review from Code Owners" on `main`.
# A required code-owner review cannot be satisfied by the Dependabot Auto-Merge app, so turning it on
# would silently prevent every automated security fix from ever merging -- which is the opposite of
# what the auto-merge remediation path is for. Gate merges on the required CI status check instead.

